{"app":"spr-flow","version":3,"nodes":[{"id":"note","type":"info","position":{"x":-806,"y":-425},"data":{"title":"SPR by grating coupling (RCWA)","text":"Gold grating (Λ = 500 nm, 40 nm deep, fill 0.5) on gold, 633 nm, light from air. The −1 order excites the surface plasmon (TM): for a shallow grating sin θ = λ/Λ − n_sp, n_sp = Re √(ε_Au/(ε_Au + 1)) → θ ≈ 12.8°; the 40 nm deep grating shifts the dip to ≈ 10.5° (try a smaller depth).\n\nCompute RCWA: 15 orders. Plot: R total and the orders. The RCWA field map (press Run) shows the plasmon at the dip; the Field profile node cuts it along z at a chosen x; View Grating shows the profile.","color":"#8a93a6","width":360,"height":260}},{"id":"air","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":-47},"data":{"materialId":"Air","color":"#f4f6fa","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"au","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":201},"data":{"materialId":"Au","color":"#e0b43c","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"gr","type":"grating","position":{"x":-390,"y":-47},"data":{"label":"Au grating","profile":"lamellar","period":500,"thickness":40,"fill":0.5,"fillTop":0.3,"shift":0.5,"slices":10,"nx":32,"pixels":[],"materials":2}},{"id":"stack","type":"combine","position":{"x":78,"y":71},"data":{"name":"Grating on gold","count":1}},{"id":"wl","type":"param","position":{"x":78,"y":-236},"data":{"quantity":"lambda","mode":"constant","value":633,"min":500,"max":900,"step":1}},{"id":"th","type":"param","position":{"x":78,"y":389},"data":{"quantity":"theta","mode":"range","value":12,"min":0,"max":30,"step":0.1}},{"id":"rc","type":"rcwa","position":{"x":572,"y":47},"data":{"name":"SPR grating","polarization":"p","orders":15,"show":1}},{"id":"fwhm","type":"fwhm","position":{"x":1170,"y":-307},"data":{"kind":"dip","field":"R","along":"","method":"local","level":0.5,"intervals":[{"lo":{"$num":"NaN"},"hi":{"$num":"NaN"}}],"color":"#f28e2b"}},{"id":"plot","type":"plot","position":{"x":1768,"y":-354},"data":